WEBVTT

01:36.520 --> 01:39.320
EPISODE 2

01:49.720 --> 01:51.280
Mom, can you believe it?

01:51.360 --> 01:52.560
That pigeon-cage-like house

01:52.640 --> 01:54.440
costs five strings of coins.

01:54.520 --> 01:56.000
Isn't that just robbery?

01:56.080 --> 01:57.000
If life is so tough,

01:57.080 --> 01:58.560
we should pack up and head home.

02:03.200 --> 02:04.240
Our land has been sold.

02:04.320 --> 02:06.600
Mom's boasted to the neighbors.

02:06.680 --> 02:08.600
She said we'll stay here from now on.

02:08.680 --> 02:10.160
Going back to be teased?

02:11.080 --> 02:12.280
That's true.

02:12.360 --> 02:14.240
Eldest cousin was so shocked by you,

02:14.320 --> 02:15.560
he's still lying crooked.

02:16.320 --> 02:18.160
Even second uncle's beams got taken down.

02:18.240 --> 02:20.160
Let's just lay low for a while.

02:20.240 --> 02:21.840
They drained our canals,

02:21.920 --> 02:23.240
tried to take our fields.

02:23.320 --> 02:25.320
Crops are ruined.

02:25.400 --> 02:27.040
I only scared him

02:27.120 --> 02:28.160
as a warning.

02:29.000 --> 02:30.120
If you hadn't stopped me,

02:30.200 --> 02:32.040
he wouldn't be so normal now!

02:37.280 --> 02:38.160
Loot at you.

02:38.240 --> 02:39.960
Calm down.

02:40.040 --> 02:41.000
She has changed.

02:41.080 --> 02:42.600
Now her morals have been cultivated.

02:42.680 --> 02:44.080
Her temper is under control.

02:44.160 --> 02:45.000
Don't be angry, Mom.

02:45.680 --> 02:46.520
That's right.

02:49.120 --> 02:50.080
Mom.

02:52.440 --> 02:53.960
My approach to terrible relatives

02:54.040 --> 02:55.560
might be a bit extreme.

02:55.640 --> 02:56.960
It's over now.

02:57.680 --> 02:59.680
Once I arrived in the capital,

02:59.760 --> 03:02.040
I transformed into a lady.

03:02.120 --> 03:03.160
Don't worry, Mom.

03:03.240 --> 03:05.080
If someone spits at me,

03:05.160 --> 03:06.880
I'll stay quiet,

03:06.960 --> 03:08.200
leaving it to dry by itself.

03:09.880 --> 03:10.720
Problem solved.

03:10.800 --> 03:11.760
Mom.

03:11.840 --> 03:13.880
No worries. You can stay at Fan's Mansion.

03:14.680 --> 03:16.360
I will care for you.

03:16.440 --> 03:18.840
It'll help with marriage matches
for the other sisters.

03:20.040 --> 03:21.600
Brother-in-law's terrible habit

03:21.680 --> 03:23.080
takes time to change.

03:23.160 --> 03:24.520
Next time when he misbehaves,

03:24.600 --> 03:25.840
what should Mom do about it?

03:26.840 --> 03:28.760
Living under someone else's roof
feels wrong.

03:28.840 --> 03:31.480
You can't do whatever you like.
Renting a place is better.

03:32.680 --> 03:34.680
We can't live off our savings forever.

03:34.760 --> 03:35.960
In a year,

03:36.040 --> 03:38.160
the money we got for our land
will be depleted.

03:38.240 --> 03:39.360
Beg on the street then?

03:50.200 --> 03:52.800
Since no one agrees,

03:52.880 --> 03:53.920
why don't we decide

03:54.720 --> 03:55.600
like we did as kids?

04:13.000 --> 04:13.840
Then I will decide?

04:14.560 --> 04:16.560
- We are all yours.
- All yours.

04:21.320 --> 04:23.240
The jackal relatives are behind us.

04:23.320 --> 04:25.040
The world is uncertain in front of us.

04:25.120 --> 04:26.080
So, our best bet

04:26.160 --> 04:27.880
is to start a business here.

04:27.960 --> 04:29.320
Work together as a family.

04:29.400 --> 04:30.720
We'll be safe and comfortable.

04:30.800 --> 04:32.640
But marriage worries Mom the most.

04:32.720 --> 04:34.720
No matter what we think,

04:34.800 --> 04:36.360
we have to please her.

04:46.080 --> 04:46.920
Let's go.

04:55.320 --> 04:58.320
Mom, marriage is up to fate,

04:58.400 --> 05:00.120
not wealth.

05:00.200 --> 05:02.840
Most people spend a lot on dowries.

05:02.920 --> 05:04.320
We don't have much,

05:04.400 --> 05:05.320
but even if we did,

05:05.400 --> 05:06.960
we won't chase that trend.

05:07.840 --> 05:08.680
Look at us.

05:08.760 --> 05:10.800
We're charming

05:10.880 --> 05:12.240
and smart.

05:12.320 --> 05:13.280
Dowry or not,

05:13.360 --> 05:15.120
we'll find good matches.

05:16.440 --> 05:17.480
Really?

05:18.600 --> 05:20.560
Yes, we sisters discussed it.

05:20.640 --> 05:22.040
The house we saw,

05:22.120 --> 05:23.160
we'll not rent it.

05:23.240 --> 05:24.680
We'll choose a busier area

05:24.760 --> 05:26.040
and start a business.

05:26.840 --> 05:28.520
We can do business anywhere.

05:28.600 --> 05:30.760
Why must it be here?

05:30.840 --> 05:32.280
Mom,

05:32.360 --> 05:34.160
renting a shop, making money,

05:34.240 --> 05:36.560
that's just part of it.

05:36.640 --> 05:37.800
The key…

05:38.600 --> 05:40.360
Matchmakers always talk big.

05:40.440 --> 05:43.040
All of them, right?

05:43.960 --> 05:45.360
Second sister suffers because of it.

05:45.960 --> 05:47.120
Mom,

05:47.200 --> 05:49.320
would you allow that to happen to us?

05:54.640 --> 05:56.080
You're right.

05:57.040 --> 06:00.280
By opening our doors,
I can pick the suitors myself.

06:03.520 --> 06:04.360
Great.

06:06.600 --> 06:07.440
Oh.

06:08.800 --> 06:10.720
Portraits. Where are the portraits?

06:10.800 --> 06:11.920
Portraits?

06:13.840 --> 06:15.080
I forgot to take it.

06:16.120 --> 06:17.000
Oh no, this is bad.

06:17.080 --> 06:17.920
- You…
- Mom.

06:18.000 --> 06:18.920
- My portraits…
- Mom.

06:19.640 --> 06:20.480
Mom!

06:20.560 --> 06:22.200
- Mom, are you okay?
- Mom.

06:22.280 --> 06:23.600
- Mom!
- Mom.

06:23.680 --> 06:25.000
- My…
- Water!

06:25.080 --> 06:25.920
- Drink some.
- Water.

06:26.000 --> 06:26.960
Mom!

06:27.600 --> 06:28.920
- Mom.
- Mom.

06:44.240 --> 06:45.560
These are all good.

06:45.640 --> 06:46.880
Really?

06:46.960 --> 06:48.600
- Lady.
- Please make way.

06:48.680 --> 06:50.520
These are all good.

06:50.600 --> 06:53.040
- Let's go.
- Sir, this way.

06:53.120 --> 06:54.320
Long time no see.

06:54.400 --> 06:55.640
Come and see.

06:55.720 --> 06:56.680
How is it?

06:56.760 --> 06:57.840
These are freshly made.

06:57.920 --> 06:59.600
- Of course.
- Take your time.

07:01.120 --> 07:02.200
See you.

07:02.280 --> 07:03.280
Okay.

07:03.360 --> 07:04.240
FOUR LUCKS TEA HOUSE

07:04.320 --> 07:05.160
Come again.

07:07.880 --> 07:10.360
Do you want to try one?

07:11.040 --> 07:12.040
The third lady of Li?

07:12.760 --> 07:14.920
Mom, you have five daughters.

07:15.000 --> 07:16.960
Why don't we call it Five Lucks?

07:17.720 --> 07:18.720
What do you know?

07:18.800 --> 07:20.520
The final luck

07:20.600 --> 07:22.880
has not arrived yet.

07:23.520 --> 07:25.040
Water surges only to overflow.

07:25.120 --> 07:26.360
Full luck is easy to fall.

07:26.440 --> 07:27.560
Being too lucky

07:27.640 --> 07:29.200
isn't necessarily good.

07:29.280 --> 07:30.120
Mom's right.

07:30.200 --> 07:32.400
I think four lucks are enough.

07:32.480 --> 07:35.720
Once you're all married,

07:35.800 --> 07:37.000
I'll display

07:37.080 --> 07:38.240
all five lucks

07:38.320 --> 07:40.160
for everyone to see.

07:43.880 --> 07:45.000
I like this.

07:49.600 --> 07:51.520
Mom, don't worry.

07:51.600 --> 07:53.400
The shop will do well here.

07:54.680 --> 07:56.360
We'll use the front room for business.

07:56.440 --> 07:58.600
There is a middle courtyard

07:58.680 --> 08:00.920
for laundry.

08:01.000 --> 08:02.920
We can live in the back.

08:03.000 --> 08:04.560
We replaced all the furniture.

08:04.640 --> 08:06.760
There's a back door for easy access.

08:06.840 --> 08:08.800
You don't need to enter
through the front door.

08:08.880 --> 08:09.840
Let's go check it out.

08:10.840 --> 08:11.680
Okay.

08:12.240 --> 08:13.360
A counter?

08:16.040 --> 08:18.120
Opening a tea house?

08:23.000 --> 08:24.000
Hurry up.

08:25.760 --> 08:27.920
- Come inside.
- Off to steal?

08:28.000 --> 08:29.200
What's with this look?

08:30.960 --> 08:32.120
My wife will see me.

08:32.200 --> 08:34.760
If you're scared, why did you come?
Rather go back.

08:35.760 --> 08:36.760
Buddy.

08:37.440 --> 08:39.160
- Bro.
- Don't touch me.

08:39.240 --> 08:41.400
Lately, my wife's been getting tougher.

08:41.480 --> 08:43.320
Taverns, tea houses, and opera houses.

08:43.400 --> 08:44.680
I can't go to any of them.

08:44.760 --> 08:46.360
She kept me at home to do accounting.

08:46.440 --> 08:48.880
Old managers came in for business all day.

08:48.960 --> 08:50.080
I got quizzed every night.

08:50.160 --> 08:51.880
If I couldn't answer,
I couldn't use the bed.

08:51.960 --> 08:54.440
I slept on the couch for three days.

08:54.520 --> 08:56.760
- Cousin.
- Better for you.

08:56.840 --> 08:58.440
- Cousin!
- If you keep messing up,

08:58.520 --> 09:01.120
you won't know
where your fabric shops are.

09:01.200 --> 09:03.400
My dear cousin.

09:04.640 --> 09:06.560
I feel terrible.

09:06.640 --> 09:08.000
No alcohol starting yesterday.

09:08.080 --> 09:09.840
She grounded me for two days.

09:09.920 --> 09:10.880
If you don't help,

09:10.960 --> 09:12.720
I'll suffocate.

09:12.800 --> 09:14.400
I won't intervene in your family matters.

09:15.000 --> 09:16.320
If you won't do anything,

09:16.400 --> 09:17.760
someone else will.

09:17.840 --> 09:18.840
You don't know

09:18.920 --> 09:20.640
how tough my third sister-in-law is.

09:21.240 --> 09:23.040
I feel terrible.

09:23.680 --> 09:24.960
- Stop whining.
- Sir,

09:25.040 --> 09:25.880
I've inquired.

09:25.960 --> 09:27.320
They don't just sell tea.

09:27.400 --> 09:29.200
It's more like a tavern.

09:29.280 --> 09:30.680
They also sell noodles and soup.

09:31.360 --> 09:32.600
They don't know the trades.

09:32.680 --> 09:34.320
No proper tea house does that business.

09:34.400 --> 09:35.880
Such a joke.

09:35.960 --> 09:37.480
What do you know?

09:37.560 --> 09:39.320
There are over a thousand tea houses.

09:39.400 --> 09:42.320
Because it costs little to start,
with only one waiter,

09:42.400 --> 09:43.640
anyone can run a tea house.

09:43.720 --> 09:46.240
But it's also tough
as there are competitors around.

09:46.320 --> 09:48.000
It is not an easy business.

09:48.080 --> 09:49.240
East Street

09:49.320 --> 09:51.320
starts trading at dawn.

09:51.400 --> 09:53.920
The early shift workers
need a place to rest.

09:54.000 --> 09:56.000
My tavern is situated here.

09:56.080 --> 09:57.680
Tapping on the vibe and visitors,

09:57.760 --> 09:59.440
they can sell cheap tea and snacks.

10:00.040 --> 10:01.800
That's the smart, long-term way.

10:03.480 --> 10:07.120
Wow, what's inside your head?

10:07.200 --> 10:08.600
How are you so much smarter than me?

10:08.680 --> 10:10.800
Help me figure out

10:10.880 --> 10:13.160
how to deal with my wife.

10:13.240 --> 10:14.400
Aunt's probably

10:14.480 --> 10:15.640
on her way back, right?

10:19.000 --> 10:19.920
Got it.

10:20.640 --> 10:21.800
Ask my mom to help me out.

10:21.880 --> 10:22.840
Deqing,

10:24.360 --> 10:25.440
from today, tell everyone

10:25.520 --> 10:27.560
that the early shift workers are welcome.

10:27.640 --> 10:28.920
Sir,

10:29.000 --> 10:31.280
our top-quality tea costs five strings

10:31.360 --> 10:33.240
just for a few brews and sips.

10:33.320 --> 10:35.880
Our low-grade tea costs 200 coins a catty.

10:35.960 --> 10:37.240
The shop across the road

10:37.320 --> 10:38.400
sells loose tea.

10:38.480 --> 10:40.280
It's only 20-30 coins a catty.

10:40.360 --> 10:41.280
We're not the same.

10:41.360 --> 10:42.360
Cousin,

10:42.440 --> 10:44.400
this will ruin Pan's reputation.

10:44.480 --> 10:47.120
Let them have a place to rest and talk.

10:47.200 --> 10:48.720
We serve 200 tea sets a day

10:48.800 --> 10:50.360
at five to ten coins each.

10:50.440 --> 10:51.440
That's enough.

10:51.520 --> 10:53.000
I won't sell

10:53.080 --> 10:54.120
the cheap tea.

10:54.200 --> 10:55.920
Let the street vendors come in instead.

10:56.840 --> 10:59.560
I'm not making it hard on purpose.

10:59.640 --> 11:01.600
She wants to take advantage
of the location.

11:01.680 --> 11:03.240
If I give her the chance

11:04.160 --> 11:06.760
to steal my customers,

11:06.840 --> 11:08.000
my business here

11:08.080 --> 11:09.480
will be tough.

11:12.000 --> 11:14.160
No wonder they opened their shop here.

11:14.240 --> 11:16.240
That is what she's aiming for.

11:16.320 --> 11:17.680
That's some trick.

11:18.400 --> 11:19.720
Get up, get up, hurry!

11:19.800 --> 11:21.280
Don't waste the morning.

11:24.160 --> 11:25.200
My third daughter Kangning?

11:28.320 --> 11:29.240
My eldest Shouhua?

11:30.800 --> 11:31.960
Well…

11:32.040 --> 11:33.480
Where did everyone go?

12:04.160 --> 12:05.000
Mom.

12:12.760 --> 12:13.840
- Mom.
- Mom.

12:25.040 --> 12:26.040
The fire's too small.

12:30.960 --> 12:33.480
You are early today.

12:34.360 --> 12:35.720
Hurry up, Ms. Liu.

12:35.800 --> 12:36.720
- Hot. Be careful.
- Okay.

12:36.800 --> 12:37.960
- Let me.
- Chunlai, be careful.

12:38.680 --> 12:40.640
Wake up little four Haode
and little five Leshan.

12:40.720 --> 12:42.400
I'll go help too.

12:43.000 --> 12:44.040
Okay, Mom.

12:44.800 --> 12:46.440
These steamed buns smell great.

12:48.920 --> 12:49.920
Haode, Leshan,

12:50.000 --> 12:51.280
get up.

12:52.160 --> 12:53.360
You're awake?

12:54.080 --> 12:55.240
Big sis,

12:55.320 --> 12:56.520
what are you doing?

12:56.600 --> 12:59.480
Wash your face.
It's hot water. Be careful.

12:59.560 --> 13:00.720
Let's go.

13:00.800 --> 13:02.000
Be careful.

13:03.040 --> 13:05.720
- You got some in my eye.
- I'm going to wash my face.

13:05.800 --> 13:06.640
PAN RESTAURANT

13:06.720 --> 13:07.680
We're newly opened.

13:07.760 --> 13:09.200
Come check it out.

13:09.280 --> 13:10.760
SIFU FOUR LUCKS TEA HOUSE

13:10.840 --> 13:12.400
We're open. Come check it out.

13:13.000 --> 13:14.000
We're open.

13:14.080 --> 13:15.720
Come taste the flavors.

13:15.800 --> 13:17.760
- Excuse me.
- Sir, this way.

13:17.840 --> 13:18.680
Watch your step.

13:20.360 --> 13:21.280
Sir,

13:21.360 --> 13:22.200
we just opened.

13:22.280 --> 13:23.560
We have tea and snacks.

13:23.640 --> 13:24.720
Please come in.

13:24.800 --> 13:25.640
- Welcome.
- Okay.

13:25.720 --> 13:26.960
Please, right this way.

13:27.040 --> 13:28.040
- Come.
- Right this way.

13:29.240 --> 13:30.600
Well, never mind.

13:30.680 --> 13:31.520
Don't leave.

13:35.600 --> 13:36.520
Come on.

13:36.600 --> 13:38.280
The morning market's just finished.

13:38.360 --> 13:39.360
Hurry up. Sell it.

13:39.440 --> 13:40.320
Quick.

13:40.400 --> 13:42.240
The snacks from Pan
are made by master chefs.

13:42.840 --> 13:44.600
Five coins for two dishes.

13:44.680 --> 13:45.720
Ten coins for four dishes.

13:46.360 --> 13:48.280
Everyone's eager to try.

13:48.880 --> 13:50.400
Tea vendors sell tea scraps.

13:50.480 --> 13:51.320
One coin for a cup.

13:51.400 --> 13:52.560
In a few days,

13:52.640 --> 13:54.480
they'll take all our morning business.

13:55.360 --> 13:56.200
Mind your work.

13:59.160 --> 14:01.080
A little bit,

14:01.160 --> 14:03.280
just tiny bits of business,

14:03.360 --> 14:06.160
you just won't let go.

14:06.240 --> 14:07.760
What kind of world is this?

14:07.840 --> 14:09.480
Eating meat alone,

14:09.560 --> 14:11.520
not sharing a sip of soup.

14:11.600 --> 14:12.600
Sir, this way.

14:13.400 --> 14:15.320
Such a penny-pincher.

14:17.480 --> 14:18.520
Make an effort.

14:20.360 --> 14:21.320
We just opened.

14:21.960 --> 14:23.480
Come dine with us here.

14:23.560 --> 14:24.520
We just opened.

14:25.960 --> 14:27.400
Sir, what are you looking at?

14:31.360 --> 14:33.000
SIFU FOUR LUCKS TEA HOUSE

14:37.920 --> 14:39.320
Isn't she from Fan's family?

14:50.000 --> 14:51.320
Bitter.

14:51.400 --> 14:52.520
Bitter?

14:52.600 --> 14:55.480
This is top-quality Jianzhou white tea.
One tea cube costs a string.

14:55.560 --> 14:57.240
How could it be bitter?

14:57.320 --> 14:59.160
The tea isn't bitter,

14:59.240 --> 15:00.720
but someone feels bitter.

15:01.320 --> 15:02.280
Once they leave,

15:02.360 --> 15:03.720
the bitterness is doubled.

15:03.800 --> 15:05.560
In a few days,

15:05.640 --> 15:07.560
someone will come begging.

15:08.280 --> 15:11.880
Loose tea,15 coins.

15:11.960 --> 15:14.840
Medium tea, 20 coins and three cents.

15:14.920 --> 15:18.200
Top tea, 43 coins and four cents.

15:18.840 --> 15:20.080
Tablet tea,

15:20.160 --> 15:22.240
65 coins and four cents.

15:22.320 --> 15:23.600
Enough.

15:24.280 --> 15:25.360
Stop it.

15:26.160 --> 15:27.240
It gives me a headache.

15:28.760 --> 15:30.200
Where's Haode and Leshan?

15:31.400 --> 15:32.440
They went out.

15:32.520 --> 15:33.960
Check on other tea houses.

15:34.960 --> 15:35.800
Try this.

15:35.880 --> 15:37.920
Sugar-glazed pork is pricey.
Leave it to sell.

15:38.000 --> 15:40.000
No one buys it.

15:40.080 --> 15:41.760
I went to the morning market.

15:41.840 --> 15:43.720
In Bianjing, people eat fine foods.

15:43.800 --> 15:45.160
Only for steamed buns baozi,

15:45.240 --> 15:47.480
they have various stuffings,
chicken, duck, goose, rabbit,

15:47.560 --> 15:48.600
fish, eel,

15:48.680 --> 15:51.400
bamboo, meat. You name it.

15:52.040 --> 15:53.560
Crystal baozi and Seven Fillings baozi.

15:53.640 --> 15:54.920
The names sound great

15:55.000 --> 15:56.040
and it looks even better.

15:56.800 --> 15:58.560
No matter how good this is,

15:58.640 --> 16:00.320
we can't match them with the stuffing.

16:00.400 --> 16:01.680
How can it stand out?

16:01.760 --> 16:03.320
It's always losing money.

16:03.400 --> 16:04.320
If I didn't pay

16:04.400 --> 16:06.360
six months' rent,

16:06.440 --> 16:08.840
I'd be packing up and heading back.

16:08.920 --> 16:10.920
Why put up with this nonsense here?

16:11.000 --> 16:13.600
That black-hearted Master Chai,

16:13.680 --> 16:16.440
what grudges do we have?

16:16.520 --> 16:18.680
Why's he doing this to us?

16:19.280 --> 16:20.200
Fuhui,

16:20.280 --> 16:23.560
can you ask your husband

16:23.640 --> 16:24.880
to talk to them?

16:25.520 --> 16:27.040
A big restaurant like this,

16:27.120 --> 16:28.680
why struggle over small profits?

16:28.760 --> 16:30.600
They won't starve, right?

16:33.680 --> 16:34.720
Fuhui.

16:36.520 --> 16:37.720
Fuhui.

16:39.480 --> 16:40.400
Please?

16:41.320 --> 16:43.320
Okay, I'll tell him later.

16:44.520 --> 16:45.360
Mom.

16:45.440 --> 16:49.080
Pan is fiercely competing with Baifan.
It's normal that he wants more earnings.

16:49.160 --> 16:50.800
We want to ride on their success.

16:50.880 --> 16:52.200
They can cut it off easily.

16:53.760 --> 16:55.040
But back to the topic.

16:55.120 --> 16:56.080
In business,

16:56.160 --> 16:58.480
you have to earn with skills and tricks.

16:58.560 --> 16:59.680
We can't depend on Fuhui.

17:00.600 --> 17:03.320
If they are holding your neck now,
even if they won't strangle you,

17:03.400 --> 17:04.640
it'll be hard to breathe.

17:04.720 --> 17:05.680
What should we do then?

17:06.360 --> 17:07.760
Tell me.

17:11.560 --> 17:12.600
Fuhui,

17:13.240 --> 17:14.280
what happened?

17:16.720 --> 17:18.760
My parents-in-law came back yesterday.

17:18.840 --> 17:21.600
My husband lay in bed, complaining
about account books and headaches.

17:22.400 --> 17:23.560
Mother-in-law hugged him.

17:23.640 --> 17:24.640
She felt sorry for him.

17:24.720 --> 17:27.280
She said I'm not considerate enough.

17:28.280 --> 17:29.520
She wants to take

17:30.440 --> 17:32.400
a gentle concubine for him.

17:33.640 --> 17:34.480
What?

17:34.560 --> 17:35.600
If I don't agree,

17:35.680 --> 17:37.560
she'll have him divorce me.

17:37.640 --> 17:39.000
Nonsense!

17:39.080 --> 17:41.600
That old hag's trying to bully us.

17:41.680 --> 17:43.880
She thinks you don't have backup, huh?

17:43.960 --> 17:45.560
I've heard about

17:45.640 --> 17:47.120
families like this.

17:47.200 --> 17:48.280
They say, in a way,

17:48.360 --> 17:51.360
that men can only take a concubine
if there's no offspring at 40.

17:51.440 --> 17:53.680
But they acted differently.
So many wives live in one home.

17:53.760 --> 17:56.760
All disgusted perverts
and lecherous bastards.

17:56.840 --> 17:58.720
She is not innocent either.

17:58.800 --> 18:00.720
She thinks her son's too successful?

18:00.800 --> 18:03.040
You've only been married for two years.

18:03.120 --> 18:04.640
They want a concubine?

18:04.720 --> 18:06.000
Bullshit!

18:07.080 --> 18:08.400
I'll go tell her off.

18:09.920 --> 18:12.160
This shameless old woman.

18:12.240 --> 18:14.320
If she dares argue,

18:14.400 --> 18:16.400
I'll slap her

18:16.480 --> 18:18.080
right into the Bian River

18:18.160 --> 18:19.000
as her grave.

18:19.600 --> 18:21.240
Mom, don't stir up trouble.

18:21.320 --> 18:22.680
So what?

18:22.760 --> 18:24.280
Even if I killed her,

18:24.360 --> 18:26.000
I'll trade my life for hers.

18:26.920 --> 18:29.440
That loquacious woman.

18:29.520 --> 18:32.360
Let her be reborn as a pig or dog.

18:32.440 --> 18:33.880
Mom, calm down.

18:34.600 --> 18:37.080
If he wants a concubine, let him do it.

18:37.160 --> 18:38.120
He'll regret it.

18:38.720 --> 18:40.800
Kangning, you mean…

18:40.880 --> 18:42.400
We can't stop him from doing so.

18:43.040 --> 18:45.000
You will say the process takes time.

18:45.080 --> 18:47.440
They need to do some research on the city

18:47.520 --> 18:49.560
to find a kind and gentle girl.

18:50.520 --> 18:54.000
We need to keep
his situation under control

18:54.080 --> 18:56.440
and handle the tea house steadily.

18:56.520 --> 18:58.160
Shouhua, let's stick to the plan.

18:58.240 --> 18:59.760
Close the shop for two days.

18:59.840 --> 19:01.840
Wh-What?

19:01.920 --> 19:03.640
Close the shop?

19:03.720 --> 19:04.600
Yes.

19:05.120 --> 19:06.800
It is a rush to open the tea house.

19:06.880 --> 19:09.800
We need a new strategy.

19:10.480 --> 19:11.920
We just opened for a few days.

19:12.880 --> 19:13.880
Mom.

19:13.960 --> 19:16.320
Do you have any money left?

19:18.000 --> 19:18.840
Money?

19:20.040 --> 19:21.000
Not at all.

19:21.080 --> 19:22.720
- Of course, you do.
- No.

19:22.800 --> 19:23.920
You do.

19:26.800 --> 19:27.640
No, I don't…

19:27.720 --> 19:30.400
They also sell baozi.

19:30.480 --> 19:32.120
- Please.
- Coming right up.

19:32.200 --> 19:33.640
Freshly made baozi.

19:37.240 --> 19:38.360
I'll put this here.

19:38.440 --> 19:39.640
Wontons.

19:39.720 --> 19:40.600
See you next time.

19:45.120 --> 19:47.080
SIFU FOUR LUCKS TEA HOUSE

19:47.680 --> 19:49.840
So, that's their plan.

19:49.920 --> 19:51.200
But it's still struggling.

19:51.280 --> 19:53.040
Decorating the facade won't help much.

19:55.320 --> 19:56.160
Sir.

19:56.720 --> 19:57.720
Master Chai.

19:58.480 --> 20:00.440
The Jin family with the blue umbrella

20:00.520 --> 20:02.880
serves tender bamboo shoots and mushrooms

20:02.960 --> 20:04.200
for Three-Crisp Broth.

20:04.280 --> 20:06.320
The flatbreads nearby are famous too.

20:06.400 --> 20:09.560
To the east,
the Xia family's candies are the best.

20:09.640 --> 20:11.240
Also, Granny Zhang's cheese

20:11.320 --> 20:12.960
and Bai's honey-glazed carving candies.

20:13.040 --> 20:14.200
Wait.

20:14.280 --> 20:16.240
You want to check out all these places?

20:16.880 --> 20:18.640
Only by knowing
what the locals like to eat

20:18.720 --> 20:19.760
can we do our business.

20:19.840 --> 20:20.800
Let's go.

20:23.600 --> 20:24.520
Sir.

20:24.600 --> 20:26.240
We had some drunk guests causing trouble.

20:26.320 --> 20:27.600
We can't get rid of them.

20:27.680 --> 20:29.160
Pass on my orders.

20:29.240 --> 20:31.920
Our singers shall not gather
at the corridor of the main hall.

20:32.000 --> 20:34.200
If they're asked to come inside,
it's just for music

20:34.280 --> 20:35.160
and company.

20:35.240 --> 20:37.080
If guests misbehave,

20:37.160 --> 20:38.120
you have my permission

20:38.200 --> 20:39.440
to handle it.

20:40.720 --> 20:42.640
It is a respectable place.

20:42.720 --> 20:44.640
Singing or dancing is permitted.

20:44.720 --> 20:45.920
Prostitution?

20:46.000 --> 20:47.160
Seek that somewhere else.

20:47.880 --> 20:49.160
Got it.

20:55.800 --> 20:57.560
SIFU FOUR LUCKS TEA HOUSE

20:57.640 --> 20:59.080
It's been so long.

21:00.120 --> 21:01.640
Still no news.

21:01.720 --> 21:02.760
News?

21:03.520 --> 21:04.520
You mean Sifu?

21:05.760 --> 21:06.680
Baifan Restaurant.

21:07.440 --> 21:09.320
We got many customers
from the early market.

21:09.400 --> 21:11.680
They play a game on the first
and 15th of the month.

21:11.760 --> 21:13.600
The top-spending guests on these two days

21:13.680 --> 21:15.200
even got a gold flag as a gift.

21:15.280 --> 21:16.160
That's generous.

21:16.760 --> 21:18.680
Work is going on for Sifu for days.

21:18.760 --> 21:19.840
I secretly went to check.

21:19.920 --> 21:22.280
The open hall was bright and wide.

21:22.360 --> 21:23.440
They are making it smaller.

21:23.520 --> 21:25.160
I'm not sure what they're planning.

21:25.240 --> 21:26.160
Oh?

21:27.920 --> 21:28.920
Sir,

21:29.000 --> 21:30.200
my master sent me

21:30.280 --> 21:31.200
with a message.

21:31.280 --> 21:32.640
He says it's an urgent matter.

21:32.720 --> 21:34.520
Please spare me a moment.

21:34.600 --> 21:36.480
What could be so urgent?

21:36.560 --> 21:37.800
My master said

21:37.880 --> 21:39.240
it's a matter of life and death.

21:44.040 --> 21:44.880
FAN'S MANSION

21:44.960 --> 21:47.160
They're all good girls,

21:47.240 --> 21:48.600
just from poor families.

21:48.680 --> 21:49.680
Hard to live their life.

21:50.280 --> 21:51.880
She volunteered to be a concubine.

21:51.960 --> 21:53.320
Her parents asked for no dowry.

21:53.400 --> 21:55.960
They want her to be safe and abundant.

21:56.560 --> 21:57.840
A sack of fine rice each month,

21:57.920 --> 22:00.200
for two years. There's one rule.

22:00.280 --> 22:02.400
They need a written agreement.

22:02.480 --> 22:04.560
The girl can't be a servant

22:04.640 --> 22:05.680
or do hard labor.

22:06.280 --> 22:07.360
I say,

22:07.440 --> 22:08.960
with such beauty,

22:09.040 --> 22:10.400
who'd make her do rough work?

22:10.480 --> 22:12.200
Right?

22:13.280 --> 22:14.400
As for these two,

22:14.480 --> 22:16.280
they aren't as pretty.

22:16.360 --> 22:17.760
But they cost only 100 strings.

22:25.920 --> 22:27.360
How old are you?

22:27.440 --> 22:29.640
Can you sing? Can you tune the zither?

22:29.720 --> 22:31.280
Well,

22:31.360 --> 22:32.960
if they could play music,

22:33.040 --> 22:34.600
they'd cost more, wouldn't they?

22:35.200 --> 22:36.920
You two, come closer.

22:37.000 --> 22:38.640
Let her take a good look.

22:38.720 --> 22:40.520
Pour me a cup of tea.

22:46.680 --> 22:48.200
This is your so-called

22:48.280 --> 22:49.480
life-and-death matter?

22:50.400 --> 22:51.560
Cousin!

22:52.080 --> 22:53.600
- Cousin.
- Don't touch me.

22:54.520 --> 22:55.560
My dad said

22:55.640 --> 22:57.800
I had to ask you first
before doing anything.

22:57.880 --> 23:00.320
You can't leave me like this.

23:00.400 --> 23:01.240
Cousin.

23:01.840 --> 23:03.360
Lately,

23:03.440 --> 23:04.800
my mind has been troubled.

23:05.480 --> 23:07.400
The more I think, the more scared I get.

23:08.400 --> 23:10.000
Cousin,

23:10.080 --> 23:12.080
my dear cousin.

23:15.000 --> 23:16.840
Cousin, have a seat.

23:17.640 --> 23:18.880
Sit here.

23:21.760 --> 23:23.120
Cousin,

23:23.200 --> 23:24.480
please help me decide.

23:24.560 --> 23:25.840
Should I

23:25.920 --> 23:27.400
take a concubine or not?

23:35.680 --> 23:36.760
Which one do you like?

23:45.440 --> 23:47.640
They are not as good-looking as my wife.

23:48.520 --> 23:49.880
But mother says

23:49.960 --> 23:51.600
this is about a man's pride.

23:51.680 --> 23:53.840
No respect from the wife,
the husband will be a joke.

23:54.680 --> 23:56.000
She's determined this time

23:56.080 --> 23:58.080
to crush her arrogance

23:58.160 --> 23:59.080
and make her compliant.

24:00.680 --> 24:01.520
I am afraid…

24:01.600 --> 24:03.000
You too are scared?

24:04.440 --> 24:06.400
I'm afraid it's a trap.

24:07.040 --> 24:09.000
A deadly one.

24:15.360 --> 24:16.200
No way.

24:16.920 --> 24:18.080
It can't be.

24:18.160 --> 24:19.760
My wife always keeps her word.

24:19.840 --> 24:22.240
She never goes back on her promises.

24:22.920 --> 24:23.800
Fan Lianghan,

24:25.560 --> 24:26.400
take a good look.

24:28.400 --> 24:29.720
Is your wife

24:29.800 --> 24:32.200
the same as yesterday?

24:32.920 --> 24:34.400
Behind this,

24:34.480 --> 24:36.360
there might be some demonesses.

24:37.000 --> 24:39.920
You just got rid of a tiger,
now you're facing a wolf.

24:43.880 --> 24:46.840
Cousin, think it through.

24:46.920 --> 24:48.120
Think clearly.

24:49.320 --> 24:51.120
If you want a long life,

24:51.200 --> 24:52.520
don't take a concubine.

24:53.200 --> 24:54.400
No more bedroom dramas.

24:54.480 --> 24:55.800
- What do you take me for?
- What?

24:55.880 --> 24:56.880
Lie to me again

24:56.960 --> 24:58.800
and I'll break your leg, Fan Lianghan.

24:58.880 --> 25:00.120
Stay away from me.

25:00.200 --> 25:01.040
Cousin.

25:01.640 --> 25:02.640
My dear cousin!

25:05.120 --> 25:06.160
Honey,

25:06.240 --> 25:07.600
you are all I want.

25:07.680 --> 25:08.520
I can't ask for more.

25:08.600 --> 25:09.760
Send them back.

25:09.840 --> 25:10.680
All of them.

25:11.480 --> 25:13.240
Hey! But I brought them here for you.

25:13.320 --> 25:14.720
How can you just turn them away?

25:14.800 --> 25:16.680
Sir! Sir!

25:17.280 --> 25:19.520
What kind of man changes his mind so fast?

25:19.600 --> 25:20.920
He's clearly not interested.

25:21.000 --> 25:22.040
Xiu,

25:22.120 --> 25:23.360
give them their reward.

25:23.440 --> 25:24.400
See them off.

25:24.480 --> 25:27.400
- Sure.
- Thank you, Madam.

25:39.000 --> 25:40.480
That Chai guy is so annoying.

25:40.560 --> 25:42.160
He almost ruined everything.

25:50.920 --> 25:52.840
It's over. Why are you still bothering me?

25:53.360 --> 25:55.000
Cousin, you haven't told me

25:55.080 --> 25:55.960
what trap this is?

25:56.040 --> 25:57.400
My heart

25:57.480 --> 25:58.760
is still racing like crazy.

25:58.840 --> 26:00.960
With your simple mind,
that would stress you out.

26:01.040 --> 26:02.480
You're still not turning down

26:02.560 --> 26:03.880
the idea of concubines.

26:05.360 --> 26:07.400
I'm telling you, drop that idea now.

26:07.480 --> 26:08.320
Leave me alone.

26:18.480 --> 26:19.840
Who is she?

26:21.200 --> 26:22.240
The business has grown.

26:22.320 --> 26:23.640
Lots of unfamiliar faces.

26:23.720 --> 26:26.760
Should I ask around for you?

26:26.840 --> 26:28.640
Go, go, quickly.

26:30.240 --> 26:31.480
Cousin,

26:31.560 --> 26:32.960
you come and go every day.

26:33.560 --> 26:35.520
Haven't you noticed

26:35.600 --> 26:38.040
she has the same eyes as my wife?

26:38.120 --> 26:40.120
If I had time to check on girls,

26:40.200 --> 26:41.400
I'd rather read my books.

26:42.200 --> 26:43.120
Get up.

26:43.200 --> 26:45.440
Cousin, with your temper,

26:45.520 --> 26:48.200
you'll scare your wife off with one word.

26:48.280 --> 26:49.640
Ten coffins couldn't be enough.

26:51.080 --> 26:54.200
- Get up.
- I'm not done looking yet.

26:55.840 --> 26:57.400
Sir, I have the details.

26:57.480 --> 26:59.600
That woman lives on South Slant Street.

26:59.680 --> 27:01.000
She was heading to Guangzhou.

27:01.080 --> 27:02.320
She got separated

27:02.400 --> 27:04.440
and tricked by bad guys.
She came here as a performer.

27:05.040 --> 27:06.200
After hearing this,

27:06.280 --> 27:08.000
Master Fan rushed to pay for her freedom.

27:08.080 --> 27:09.480
He even set a date

27:09.560 --> 27:11.200
to marry her in five days.

27:12.000 --> 27:12.960
Something feels off.

27:14.880 --> 27:16.160
Are you having doubts?

27:17.400 --> 27:18.360
I don't know why.

27:18.440 --> 27:19.400
Something isn't right.

27:19.480 --> 27:21.040
That fool has no clue

27:21.120 --> 27:22.280
what mistake he's making.

27:22.360 --> 27:24.040
I'll dig deeper?

27:25.720 --> 27:26.720
SIFU FOUR LUCKS TEA HOUSE

27:26.800 --> 27:27.800
No.

27:27.880 --> 27:28.960
I'll investigate myself.

27:39.960 --> 27:42.200
Snacks from Pan,
requested by the third lady.

27:42.280 --> 27:43.320
Just this little plate.

27:43.400 --> 27:45.960
Sweet, savory, meaty, mild, all in one.

27:46.560 --> 27:48.320
This candied plum mille-feuille alone

27:48.400 --> 27:50.360
must've taken so much effort.

27:50.440 --> 27:52.560
I'm good at making snacks.

27:52.640 --> 27:53.520
Not many desserts

27:53.600 --> 27:55.080
are too hard for me.

27:55.160 --> 27:56.440
But I am not that confident now.

27:57.040 --> 27:59.000
Four pieces cost ten coins?

27:59.080 --> 28:00.600
Early market goers

28:00.680 --> 28:02.240
or night workers

28:02.320 --> 28:03.800
might pay for fun,

28:03.880 --> 28:04.920
but not every day.

28:05.000 --> 28:07.160
Bite-sized snacks don't fill you up.

28:07.240 --> 28:09.760
I say we go for Qiongnu's specialty,
roasted flatbread.

28:10.360 --> 28:12.440
Slice the flatbread into thin pieces.

28:12.520 --> 28:13.400
Coat it with honey.

28:13.480 --> 28:14.520
Roast it to be crispy.

28:14.600 --> 28:16.120
Fragrant and filling.

28:16.200 --> 28:18.000
I am afraid the folks in Bianjing

28:18.080 --> 28:18.960
will find it cheap.

28:19.640 --> 28:21.400
We are not using expensive ingredients.

28:21.480 --> 28:22.640
It must feel refined.

28:23.600 --> 28:24.840
Give it another name.

28:24.920 --> 28:26.840
Slice them into the shape of leaves.

28:26.920 --> 28:28.440
When you chew, it makes a crispy sound.

28:28.520 --> 28:30.000
Let's call it Crispy Leaves.

28:30.600 --> 28:31.960
Kangning, what do you think?

28:32.040 --> 28:33.280
True.

28:35.880 --> 28:36.720
Let me.

28:58.360 --> 28:59.200
Use the back door.

29:09.240 --> 29:10.320
Switch to sesame oil.

29:10.400 --> 29:11.280
Less smoke.

29:11.960 --> 29:13.720
Not sure if your plan will work.

29:13.800 --> 29:15.560
Let's save money on the lighting.

29:18.320 --> 29:19.360
Honestly,

29:19.440 --> 29:21.440
it's all that meddler's fault.

29:21.520 --> 29:23.000
One day,

29:23.080 --> 29:25.120
I'll teach him a lesson.

29:26.160 --> 29:27.400
Look at you.

29:31.520 --> 29:32.840
Master Zhang, what a rare guest!

29:32.920 --> 29:34.360
Come. I'll take you inside.

29:35.240 --> 29:36.960
- Right this way.
- You're back, sir.

29:37.040 --> 29:38.640
Your family has been asking about you.

29:39.240 --> 29:41.120
Tell them I'm fine.
I've got something to do.

29:41.200 --> 29:43.000
Be back at dusk.
Tell my mother not to worry.

29:46.280 --> 29:47.880
Where is he rushing off to?

29:47.960 --> 29:48.920
To save someone.

29:49.560 --> 29:50.520
Let's go.

29:56.560 --> 29:58.720
Master Chai, here to celebrate?

29:58.800 --> 29:59.640
What celebration?

29:59.720 --> 30:01.880
My master is taking a new concubine.

30:01.960 --> 30:03.720
Didn't we send your family an invite?

30:03.800 --> 30:04.920
Master Fan said

30:05.000 --> 30:07.040
he wanted to share the joy with you.

30:07.120 --> 30:08.640
What? You didn't get it?

30:08.720 --> 30:10.000
Isn't it tomorrow?

30:10.080 --> 30:11.400
The date changed.

30:13.320 --> 30:14.360
Sir, sir.

30:28.480 --> 30:29.680
Look at her.

30:29.760 --> 30:32.120
So pretty

30:32.200 --> 30:33.400
and gentle.

30:33.480 --> 30:34.320
MADAM FAN

30:34.400 --> 30:36.240
My boy's so lucky.

30:36.840 --> 30:39.400
Enough. Go serve tea to your mistress.

30:40.080 --> 30:41.080
Once she drinks it,

30:41.160 --> 30:42.600
you'll officially join the family.

30:42.680 --> 30:44.200
You're one of us.

30:50.480 --> 30:51.680
Why are you crying?

30:51.760 --> 30:53.280
Lady Zhen,

30:53.360 --> 30:54.480
why are you crying

30:55.080 --> 30:56.200
on such a good day?

30:58.720 --> 31:01.320
Were you forced into this?

31:02.120 --> 31:03.480
- Fan Lianghan?
- Dad.

31:03.560 --> 31:04.560
I wouldn't dare!

31:05.240 --> 31:07.240
Lady Zhen, speak for me!

31:08.120 --> 31:09.840
I'm from a scholar's family in Jianzhou.

31:09.920 --> 31:11.680
My family had a career in the government.

31:12.320 --> 31:13.160
Six years ago,

31:13.240 --> 31:15.040
he died

31:15.120 --> 31:16.680
in his position.

31:16.760 --> 31:18.640
Mother and I took a journey
to find my relatives.

31:19.240 --> 31:21.640
On the way, I was tricked by criminals

31:22.680 --> 31:24.680
and forced into prostitution.

31:24.760 --> 31:27.080
Today, the Fan family saved me.

31:27.160 --> 31:28.600
Finally, I have a shelter.

31:29.600 --> 31:31.800
Seeing your kindness reminds me

31:31.880 --> 31:33.720
of my late parents.

31:34.680 --> 31:36.280
I feel ashamed

31:36.360 --> 31:38.000
to dishonor my ancestors.

31:39.600 --> 31:41.000
I couldn't hold back my tears.

31:41.080 --> 31:42.080
What?

31:42.160 --> 31:43.120
You're a…?

31:43.960 --> 31:47.000
So that's the story.

31:48.400 --> 31:51.160
How pitiful.

31:51.240 --> 31:52.440
Bring me some silver.

31:59.560 --> 32:00.520
Th-This is…?

32:00.600 --> 32:03.480
This is all my son's fault.

32:04.480 --> 32:08.840
We're only merchants, and can't reach for
a noble scholar's daughter like you.

32:08.920 --> 32:11.440
This is ridiculous.
Sorry for involving you in this.

32:11.520 --> 32:12.640
Take this money

32:13.320 --> 32:14.600
as compensation.

32:14.680 --> 32:16.200
Rest assured, young lady,

32:16.280 --> 32:18.920
I'll send someone to take you home.

32:19.000 --> 32:21.800
You can find your mother
and be with her safely.

32:21.880 --> 32:24.080
- Dad?
- Great goodness, thank you, my lord.

32:24.160 --> 32:25.840
I'll never forget.

32:30.440 --> 32:32.880
The master promised to send you home.

32:32.960 --> 32:34.080
He'll keep his word.

32:34.160 --> 32:36.040
Cheer up. It's good news.

32:36.120 --> 32:37.360
Wipe your tears.

32:40.080 --> 32:41.360
It's over.

32:42.080 --> 32:43.080
What?

32:43.840 --> 32:44.680
Master Chai.

32:44.760 --> 32:46.760
A merchant

32:46.840 --> 32:48.440
marrying a scholar's daughter?

32:48.520 --> 32:49.920
Are you insane?

32:50.000 --> 32:51.560
What are you thinking?

32:51.640 --> 32:53.040
If word spreads,

32:53.120 --> 32:54.440
our whole family will suffer.

32:54.520 --> 32:56.080
I'll be ruined!

32:56.160 --> 32:57.920
You ungrateful fool!

32:58.000 --> 32:59.600
Stop, stop! Don't hit him!

33:01.560 --> 33:03.240
What grudge did I owe in my past life?

33:03.840 --> 33:05.680
A useless son and an unworthy wife.

33:05.760 --> 33:07.920
You even pushed him to take a concubine.

33:08.560 --> 33:10.400
You're the root of this misfortune!

33:10.480 --> 33:11.720
I'll deal with you later!

33:11.800 --> 33:13.760
Out of my way, you fool.

33:13.840 --> 33:15.160
- Father-in-law, please!
- Don't run!

33:15.240 --> 33:16.120
- Dear!
- I know nothing!

33:16.200 --> 33:17.480
I'm innocent!

33:17.560 --> 33:18.800
Stop! Please calm down.

33:19.320 --> 33:20.560
It's all my fault

33:20.640 --> 33:21.880
for not stopping him.

33:21.960 --> 33:23.320
If he's guilty,

33:23.400 --> 33:24.560
I share the responsibility.

33:25.200 --> 33:27.400
Punish me instead.

33:27.480 --> 33:29.240
Stay out of this! No one interferes!

33:29.320 --> 33:30.960
- You brat.
- Uncle.

33:31.040 --> 33:32.680
- Un--
- Cousin!

33:32.760 --> 33:34.640
My dad's going to kill me.

33:35.920 --> 33:37.880
Uncle, it is still hot outside.

33:37.960 --> 33:38.800
Don't let the heat

33:38.880 --> 33:40.520
and anger get to you. Be careful.

33:40.600 --> 33:42.360
You shall hit me first
before getting to him.

33:43.040 --> 33:46.280
Nephew An, beg for mercy for him.

33:47.080 --> 33:47.920
Uncle,

33:48.000 --> 33:49.720
the performer had a tragic life.

33:49.800 --> 33:51.760
She was sold off
or tricked into this life.

33:51.840 --> 33:53.520
The owners have ways
to cover everything up.

33:53.600 --> 33:54.960
We can never verify everything.

33:55.600 --> 33:57.800
Lady Zhen kept quiet

33:57.880 --> 33:59.640
for her family's honor.

34:00.400 --> 34:01.920
You know your son best.

34:02.000 --> 34:03.120
His personality

34:03.200 --> 34:05.200
is kind and softhearted.

34:06.040 --> 34:07.320
So, he fell for the trap.

34:09.280 --> 34:11.120
He's learned his lesson now.

34:11.200 --> 34:13.000
- He won't do it again.
- That's okay.

34:13.080 --> 34:14.000
So,

34:14.640 --> 34:16.320
for my sake,

34:16.840 --> 34:19.400
spare him this time.

34:20.040 --> 34:21.200
A disgrace to the family.

34:21.280 --> 34:23.400
A disgrace to the family!

34:25.080 --> 34:26.360
Father-in-law.

34:27.960 --> 34:29.400
Mom.

34:29.480 --> 34:31.480
It's okay, I'm here. Don't be scared.

34:31.560 --> 34:33.640
Honey, are you alright?

34:34.760 --> 34:35.960
Honey,

34:37.160 --> 34:39.480
you're the only one who loves me!

34:39.560 --> 34:41.040
Okay. That's fine.

34:45.920 --> 34:47.000
It hurts so much.

34:47.080 --> 34:48.840
I know. Come here.

34:49.680 --> 34:52.280
Ow, ow, ow!

34:52.360 --> 34:54.640
He hit you so hard.

34:54.720 --> 34:56.200
How long will it take to heal?

34:56.280 --> 34:57.800
Lady Zhen.

34:58.360 --> 34:59.760
She set me up.

35:00.360 --> 35:03.080
You were right about this.

35:03.160 --> 35:05.280
Beauty is a trap.

35:05.360 --> 35:07.040
Those vixens

35:07.120 --> 35:09.040
will skin me alive.

35:10.920 --> 35:13.080
I'll never take a concubine again.

35:13.160 --> 35:15.200
Never again, not in this life.

35:15.280 --> 35:17.000
If I do,

35:17.080 --> 35:19.680
I shall be split into two pieces
by lightning.

35:19.760 --> 35:21.080
- One piece for you.
- Sure.

35:21.160 --> 35:22.720
As your umbrella.

35:22.800 --> 35:25.680
The other half will be your footstool.

35:25.760 --> 35:27.800
For you to tread on

35:27.880 --> 35:29.160
for the rest of my life.

35:31.840 --> 35:34.800
It hurts so much.

35:35.520 --> 35:37.080
Okay, I know.

35:37.160 --> 35:38.120
Master Chai,

35:38.200 --> 35:39.240
didn't you have words

35:39.320 --> 35:40.840
for him?

35:40.920 --> 35:42.560
I'll go inform him for you.

35:42.640 --> 35:43.480
No need.

35:43.960 --> 35:45.360
- He's beyond saving.
- I'll be gentle.

35:45.440 --> 35:46.920
No medicine can help him.

35:47.920 --> 35:49.240
Has he been hit so badly?

35:49.320 --> 35:50.520
If I did it again…

35:50.600 --> 35:52.120
- He is so sick…
- I know.

35:52.200 --> 35:53.320
…that nothing can cure him.

35:53.400 --> 35:54.520
- You will be fine.
- Idiot.

35:54.600 --> 35:56.000
Hold on a little longer.

35:56.080 --> 35:57.520
You'll be fine soon.

35:57.600 --> 35:58.760
Thanks.

36:04.400 --> 36:05.840
I thought

36:05.920 --> 36:08.520
my whole life would be wasted
in that filthy place.

36:08.600 --> 36:10.600
I never dreamed I'd see the light of day.

36:10.680 --> 36:13.440
Now I can return home.

36:13.520 --> 36:15.080
I should thank you both for the help.

36:15.160 --> 36:16.600
Please, let me bow in gratitude.

36:17.520 --> 36:18.840
Oh no, I can't accept that.

36:19.920 --> 36:21.360
We helped you,

36:21.440 --> 36:22.520
but you helped us too.

36:23.560 --> 36:24.400
Lady Zhen,

36:24.480 --> 36:26.560
find your mother.

36:26.640 --> 36:28.080
Live well together.

36:30.760 --> 36:32.520
Just go. Don't let anyone see.

36:33.520 --> 36:34.680
Just go.

36:39.200 --> 36:40.040
Be careful.

36:43.360 --> 36:44.400
Take this to eat.

36:45.240 --> 36:46.200
Thanks.

36:57.600 --> 36:59.360
My third lady, let's go too.

37:11.120 --> 37:11.960
Stop.

37:14.400 --> 37:16.320
I saw everything just now.

37:16.920 --> 37:18.360
She's gone now.

37:18.440 --> 37:19.880
No evidence whatsoever.

37:19.960 --> 37:20.800
So what?

37:22.080 --> 37:23.000
Master Chai,

37:23.080 --> 37:25.840
it's late.
I can't stay for idle talk.

37:26.440 --> 37:27.360
Let me withdraw myself.

37:27.440 --> 37:29.520
I bid you goodbye. Chunlai.

37:41.960 --> 37:42.880
Let's go.

37:46.400 --> 37:47.520
Stop.

37:52.840 --> 37:54.880
Baozi from Dong Mei Tea House,
famous in Bianjing.

37:54.960 --> 37:56.520
I brought these for you to try.

37:56.600 --> 37:58.800
If you don't want to settle,

37:58.880 --> 38:00.160
report me if you like.

38:00.240 --> 38:01.080
I am leaving.

38:07.960 --> 38:09.080
What a waste.

38:09.160 --> 38:10.880
Two baozi with crab meet stuffing.

38:10.960 --> 38:12.680
I brought it for research.

38:16.120 --> 38:17.920
Well, like tossing baozi to a dog!

38:18.000 --> 38:18.920
She's insulting you.

38:20.840 --> 38:22.600
She meant don't meddle
around like a nosy dog.

38:23.160 --> 38:24.840
What an unruly young lady.

38:24.920 --> 38:26.120
Sir,

38:26.200 --> 38:27.960
should we tell Master Fan?

38:28.040 --> 38:30.000
That crazy coward
was in his wife's cuddle,

38:30.080 --> 38:31.800
sobbing like hell.

38:31.880 --> 38:33.120
What's the point of telling him?

38:34.480 --> 38:35.520
Let's head back.

38:39.320 --> 38:42.400
PAN RESTAURANT

38:44.720 --> 38:46.240
Alright, get going.

38:52.480 --> 38:55.200
- Distinguished guests.
- Look over here.

38:55.840 --> 38:59.440
Sifu House is now open.

38:59.520 --> 39:00.360
FRAGRANCE SHOP

39:01.480 --> 39:02.400
New Shop.

39:03.800 --> 39:04.840
It's open.

39:04.920 --> 39:05.880
Looks great.

39:05.960 --> 39:08.120
Guests, come on in!

39:08.200 --> 39:09.280
Take a look.

39:09.360 --> 39:12.200
Sifu is back in business.

39:12.280 --> 39:13.480
- Everyone.
- Come quickly.

39:13.560 --> 39:14.560
- Our shop…
- It has started.

39:14.640 --> 39:16.840
…may be small,

39:16.920 --> 39:19.240
- but it has a refined style.
- What's in it?

39:19.320 --> 39:23.080
Tea and incense, flowers and treasures,

39:23.160 --> 39:26.040
we have it all, just as you scholars like.

39:26.120 --> 39:28.680
Whether you are looking for a resting spot

39:28.760 --> 39:31.160
after strolling around the streets,

39:31.240 --> 39:32.800
or just finished shopping for treasures,

39:32.880 --> 39:34.360
at the east tower, you may want

39:34.440 --> 39:36.120
the goods to be checked and evaluated

39:36.200 --> 39:38.880
or just a cozy spot

39:38.960 --> 39:42.040
to chat over tea.

39:43.040 --> 39:46.000
This is the perfect place for you.

39:47.440 --> 39:49.880
A little shop with all four refined arts.

39:49.960 --> 39:50.840
Isn't it rare?

39:50.920 --> 39:52.720
Of course.

39:52.800 --> 39:53.920
Our shop

39:54.000 --> 39:58.160
has books, art, incense, and tea.

39:58.240 --> 40:01.280
Come in and see for yourselves.

40:01.360 --> 40:03.360
Let's go take a look.

40:03.440 --> 40:05.400
Welcome, esteemed guests.

40:05.480 --> 40:07.480
Come in.

40:07.560 --> 40:09.560
- Step inside.
- Right this way.

40:09.640 --> 40:11.840
Come in.

40:12.440 --> 40:14.000
- Right this way.
- Sir.

40:14.080 --> 40:15.280
- Let's go.
- Let's try.

40:15.360 --> 40:16.400
Sir.

40:18.120 --> 40:19.360
- Right this way.
- Hang it higher.

40:19.440 --> 40:20.280
Hang…

40:21.000 --> 40:22.200
Right this way.

40:24.000 --> 40:25.080
Welcome.

40:25.160 --> 40:26.080
Come inside.

40:26.160 --> 40:27.400
Let's go.

40:27.480 --> 40:28.320
Hang it higher.

40:28.400 --> 40:30.280
FRAGRANCE SHOP

40:31.040 --> 40:32.160
Okay. That's it.

40:34.040 --> 40:36.080
Let's see which one is higher now.

40:43.960 --> 40:46.040
- Look.
- This bottle's glaze is flawless.

40:46.120 --> 40:47.880
- Such perfect coloring.
- Looks great.

40:49.000 --> 40:50.400
- I like this.
- It's so rare.

40:50.480 --> 40:51.840
The craftsmanship is exquisite.

40:52.480 --> 40:54.960
Did this bottle catch your eye?

40:55.040 --> 40:56.480
You have a great eye.

41:00.040 --> 41:01.280
In my opinion,

41:01.360 --> 41:02.400
the word emptiness

41:02.480 --> 41:04.440
in Zhang's poem is genius.

41:04.520 --> 41:05.880
Nothing more, nothing less.

41:10.760 --> 41:11.960
This place is unique.

41:12.040 --> 41:14.160
Pity it's a bit small

41:14.240 --> 41:15.720
compared to Pan Restaurant.

41:15.800 --> 41:17.280
You're right.

41:17.360 --> 41:19.440
But your daily expense there

41:19.520 --> 41:21.320
could cover a whole month's tea here.

41:21.400 --> 41:23.560
- Really?
- That's so tacky.

41:23.640 --> 41:24.600
You see.

41:24.680 --> 41:26.440
Tea and poetry.

41:26.520 --> 41:28.720
Instruments and songs.

41:28.800 --> 41:30.720
It's all about peace of mind.

41:30.800 --> 41:32.840
Small, but charming.

41:32.920 --> 41:34.160
True,

41:34.960 --> 41:37.440
but small can also be elegant.
Grace can also be boring.

41:38.240 --> 41:40.240
- It is up to us to decide, right?
- Sure.

41:41.320 --> 41:42.880
So, they're drawing in

41:42.960 --> 41:44.720
those who can't afford our lounge?

41:44.800 --> 41:47.160
Even incorporating the fruit
and incense trades?

41:47.240 --> 41:48.440
Shameless.

41:51.800 --> 41:52.720
Cousin, you're here.

41:55.840 --> 41:57.480
That painting looks familiar.

42:01.800 --> 42:03.040
Your wound's healed?

42:03.640 --> 42:05.320
Thanks to my wife's care.

42:05.400 --> 42:06.680
I should thank you

42:06.760 --> 42:08.160
for saving my life that day.

42:09.800 --> 42:11.480
Who's running the store here?

43:02.360 --> 43:03.880
Good understanding of tea and incense.

43:04.840 --> 43:07.440
Noble daughters
may not know more than that.

43:08.480 --> 43:10.920
A small gentry family like the Li's

43:11.000 --> 43:12.880
must have high hopes for their daughters.

43:12.960 --> 43:15.440
The manager at the treasure counter
is no ordinary person.

43:15.520 --> 43:18.120
Right this way. The shop may be small.

43:18.200 --> 43:20.680
- That manager is not someone else.
- Help yourself.

43:20.760 --> 43:23.160
Mother-in-law couldn't find
the right manager.

43:23.240 --> 43:25.400
So, I recommended Manager Liao.

43:25.480 --> 43:26.640
You introduced him to me.

43:26.720 --> 43:27.760
Forgive me, cousin.

43:27.840 --> 43:29.200
My wife asked me.

43:29.280 --> 43:30.960
I had no choice.

43:33.600 --> 43:36.440
What day is it today?

43:36.520 --> 43:39.440
Master Chai graced us with his presence.

43:41.720 --> 43:42.560
Shame.

43:42.640 --> 43:44.720
Our humble shop is too small

43:44.800 --> 43:46.960
for your precious presence.

43:47.040 --> 43:48.760
So, please,

43:48.840 --> 43:50.120
kindly step aside.

43:50.200 --> 43:52.520
We have a business to run.

43:53.160 --> 43:54.400
Hey, mother-in-law.

43:54.480 --> 43:55.320
Mother.

43:55.400 --> 43:57.520
That painting's an original by Wu Daozi.

43:57.600 --> 43:59.600
I borrowed it from the Chai family.

43:59.680 --> 44:01.200
Please have some respect.

44:08.320 --> 44:09.520
This gradient glaze,

44:09.600 --> 44:11.240
it's so hard to master.

44:11.320 --> 44:15.160
Cousin, just a few days for show.

44:15.240 --> 44:16.960
I'll return it next month.

44:21.520 --> 44:22.600
Madam,

44:22.680 --> 44:23.560
I want a tea duel.

44:24.760 --> 44:26.200
The tea organizer is impressive.

44:26.280 --> 44:29.080
The tea here has creamy swirls
that linger so long.

44:29.720 --> 44:31.400
Quite talented.

44:31.480 --> 44:33.160
Can I meet this tea master?

44:33.240 --> 44:34.760
You're too kind, sir.

44:34.840 --> 44:36.480
Unmarried daughters

44:36.560 --> 44:38.040
can't meet guests.

44:38.120 --> 44:39.560
Unexpected.

44:39.640 --> 44:41.440
The tea master

44:41.520 --> 44:43.760
is a young lady?

44:43.840 --> 44:46.120
The boudoir hides many talents.

44:46.200 --> 44:47.880
Even the jasmine in this pot

44:47.960 --> 44:49.400
is sublime.

44:49.480 --> 44:50.760
Did she make this too?

44:50.840 --> 44:53.760
I am here running a business for a living.

44:53.840 --> 44:56.800
I don't want to talk about my daughters
like they are topics of conversation.

44:57.640 --> 44:59.280
So, forgive me.

45:00.200 --> 45:01.280
Enjoy your tea.

45:01.360 --> 45:02.280
Please help yourself.

45:05.360 --> 45:06.320
Forget it.

45:06.400 --> 45:07.480
We can visit here again.

45:07.560 --> 45:08.920
Plenty of chances to meet her.

45:12.840 --> 45:14.520
Cousin, wait for me.

45:14.600 --> 45:15.640
Cousin.

45:29.240 --> 45:30.800
What's so funny?

45:31.680 --> 45:33.720
I am glad that we have so many customers.

45:33.800 --> 45:34.960
Careful, it's hot!

45:36.520 --> 45:38.160
Did Master Chai offend you in some way?

45:38.240 --> 45:40.200
You asked Master Fan
to borrow that painting.

45:40.280 --> 45:41.320
Meant to upset him?

45:41.400 --> 45:42.880
He is nosy.

45:43.920 --> 45:44.960
Serves him right.

45:47.920 --> 45:49.560
Is this pastry ready yet?

45:50.160 --> 45:52.160
Cousin, why didn't you tell me earlier?

45:52.760 --> 45:54.120
I checked the source from the bawd.

45:54.200 --> 45:55.200
I tracked down the man

45:55.280 --> 45:57.040
who tricked Lady Zhen.

45:57.120 --> 45:59.080
I forced him to reveal her true story.

45:59.160 --> 46:00.400
I rushed back

46:00.480 --> 46:02.000
to tell you.

46:04.080 --> 46:04.960
Stop.

46:06.320 --> 46:07.680
The matter is settled.

46:07.760 --> 46:09.920
You want to bring this up again?
Stop dreaming.

46:10.000 --> 46:11.200
If you want another beating,

46:11.280 --> 46:12.400
I won't stop you.

46:12.480 --> 46:15.280
But how did they know

46:15.360 --> 46:16.600
I'd choose Lady Zhen?

46:16.680 --> 46:18.800
You are just crazy.
That time in Luoyang,

46:18.880 --> 46:21.560
you went to collect the rent,
you met Fuhui the first time

46:21.640 --> 46:22.880
when she was out for a walk.

46:23.840 --> 46:25.000
That was planned as well?

46:26.320 --> 46:27.560
Never mind, you won't listen.

46:27.640 --> 46:28.640
Deqing, take him away.

46:29.760 --> 46:31.960
Cousin, you have to help me here!

46:32.040 --> 46:33.720
I don't have such a foolish cousin.

46:34.640 --> 46:36.160
You're only older by half an hour,

46:36.240 --> 46:37.400
and I've called you cousin

46:37.480 --> 46:38.680
for years.

46:40.320 --> 46:42.480
Right. Also, do you remember
when you fell into the well?

46:42.560 --> 46:44.440
I cried for help and saved you.

46:44.520 --> 46:47.160
You actually wet your pants in fear.
Stop flattering yourself.

46:47.240 --> 46:48.640
Deqing, take him away.

46:48.720 --> 46:49.800
I'll listen to you then.

46:49.880 --> 46:51.000
- Get away.
- I will comply.

46:51.680 --> 46:52.760
- Get up.
- I swear.

46:52.840 --> 46:54.680
I'll never do something behind your back.

46:55.920 --> 46:57.040
For real?

47:01.360 --> 47:03.760
If you get softhearted and mess up
my plans again,

47:03.840 --> 47:05.520
I'll toss you into the well myself.

47:07.640 --> 47:08.920
Deqing.

47:09.000 --> 47:10.760
- Call Manager Liao here.
- Sure.

47:12.440 --> 47:14.000
Yes. Bring him

47:14.080 --> 47:15.440
and the painting back.

47:17.160 --> 47:18.440
Get away.

47:25.960 --> 47:26.800
Sir, come right in.

47:26.880 --> 47:27.720
- This way.
- Welcome.

47:27.800 --> 47:29.560
You had the nerve to use my manager

47:29.640 --> 47:30.960
and borrow my painting?

47:31.040 --> 47:32.680
Paying some interest sounds reasonable.

50:01.440 --> 50:03.600
Subtitle translation by: Yi Yang
